{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826060929335552","en":"Peipei","ru":"Пэйпэй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826060929335808","en":"Peipei is... training... as hard as she can...!","ru":"Пэйпэй... изо всех сил... тренируется...!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826065224302848","en":"Peipei","ru":"Пэйпэй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826065224303104","en":"Here I go—whoa, whoa!","ru":"Поехали... уа-а-а!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826069519270144","en":"Peipei","ru":"Пэйпэй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826069519270400","en":"Hah! Hup! Hee—yah!","ru":"Ха! Хуп! И-йя!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826073814237440","en":"Peipei","ru":"Пэйпэй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826073814237696","en":"Phew, that was close...","ru":"Фух, чуть не упала..."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826078109204736","en":"Peipei","ru":"Пэйпэй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826078109204992","en":"Here I go!","ru":"Вот, смотрите!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826082404172032","en":"Peipei","ru":"Пэйпэй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826082404172288","en":"Hee! Hah! Hnngh—hup...","ru":"И! Ха! Хны-ых... фу..."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826086699139328","en":"Peipei","ru":"Пэйпэй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826086699139584","en":"How was that?","ru":"Ну как?"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834650863927552","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834650863927808","en":"Hey, wanna play ball?","ru":"Эй, поиграем в мяч?"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834655158894848","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834655158895104","en":"Hah—yah!","ru":"Ха... я!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834659453862144","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834659453862400","en":"Again?","ru":"Ещё разок?"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834663748829440","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834663748829696","en":"Hup, yah, there! How's that? Ehehe!","ru":"Хуп, я, вот так! Как тебе? Хе-хе!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834668043796736","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834668043796992","en":"I'm not done yet, not by a long shot~\nCome on, let's keep going!","ru":"Это ещё не всё, далеко не всё~\nДавай, продолжаем!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834672338764032","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834672338764288","en":"Huh? Did it go off somewhere?","ru":"Ой? Куда это он укатился?"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834676633731328","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834676633731584","en":"Ugh, that far out...","ru":"У-у, так далеко..."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834680928698624","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834680928698880","en":"Hehe, all right! Here I go!","ru":"Хе-хе, ну всё! Погнали!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834685223665920","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834685223666176","en":"Wanna try again?","ru":"Ещё разок попробуем?"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834689518633216","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834689518633472","en":"Here I gooo—","ru":"Поехали-и-и..."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834693813600512","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834693813600768","en":"Whoa, whoa!","ru":"Уа-а-а!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834698108567808","en":"Tushan Xiaoyu","ru":"Тушань Сяоюй"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834698108568064","en":"Oww... geez, be gentler with me!","ru":"У-у... ну сколько можно, будь со мной помягче!"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570094901559552","en":"Metsa","ru":"Метса"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570094901559808","en":"Eek, honestly... no mischief, you hear?","ru":"Ах, ну вот... не шали, ладно?"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570099196526848","en":"Metsa","ru":"Метса"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570099196527104","en":"Mmm... You can rest a little longer, you know.","ru":"М-м-м... Можешь ещё немного отдохнуть, знаешь ли."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570103491494144","en":"Metsa","ru":"Метса"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570103491494400","en":"Oh? I'm glad you remembered me.","ru":"О? Как приятно, что ты меня вспомнил."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570107786461440","en":"Metsa","ru":"Метса"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570107786461696","en":"Shh… The little one's just sprouted and is sleeping.","ru":"Тише… Росток только что проклюнулся и сейчас спит."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570112081428736","en":"Metsa","ru":"Метса"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570112081428992","en":"Hehe, you really are a good one.","ru":"Хе-хе, ты и правда молодец."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570116376396032","en":"Metsa","ru":"Метса"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570116376396288","en":"Hmm... Growing up nicely, aren't you.","ru":"Хм... Растёте хорошо."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570120671363328","en":"Metsa","ru":"Метса"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570120671363584","en":"Eek! Oh, you... If you keep that up, I'll make you take responsibility.","ru":"Ай! Ну вот... Если продолжишь, придётся тебе отвечать."}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570124966330624","en":"Metsa","ru":"Метса"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570124966330880","en":"Even the fallen leaves deserve to be picked up.","ru":"Даже опавшие листья нужно убирать."}
